Ten files, 67,449,464 bytes in total (~67 MB, ~64 MiB). Four CUPTI
releases share the SONAME libcupti.so.12, so the SONAME alone does not
identify the Toolkit release a file came from. See README.md in this
directory for byte sizes and SHA-256 sums, for why the binaries are
bundled, for how one is selected at runtime, and for how to update or
prune the set.
